  "prefLabel": "He-C 6438.13 Applications from NH Child Placing Agencies",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "He-C 6438.13 Applications from NH Child Placing Agencies.\n\n(a) Applications for an adoption subsidy shall be accepted from any NH licensed child-placing adoption agency having a hard-to-place child.\n\n(b) Applications from other agencies shall be processed in the same manner as referrals from DCYF.\n\nSource. #8837, eff 3-8-07, EXPIRED: 3-8-15",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/he-c6400.html"
}
